                    }
                    \\,.
            %p
              Here the projections are weak equivalences as shown, because by assumption in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#QuillenIdempotentMonad"}
              the ambient model category is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+proper+model+category"} right proper
              and these projections are the pullbacks along the fibrations
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
