                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
                    %mo ∘
                    %mi π
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tilde p \circ \pi
              is a homotopy pullback, by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pasting+law"} pasting law
              for homotopy pullbacks (
              %a{:href => "Introduction+to+Stable+homotopy+theory+--+P#ClosurePropertiesOfHomotopyPullbacks"}> prop.
              ).
            %p
              In conclusion, we have exhibited
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
